[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0397","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0397.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0211","title":"Sun Solaris NFS mountd 导出列表过长致权限绕过漏洞","description":"SunOS/Solaris 系统中 NFS mount 守护进程存在访问控制绕过漏洞。当 NFS 导出列表条目超过 256 字符时，守护进程未能正确处理超长字符串，导致所有访问控制检查失效。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可挂载本应受限的 NFS 目录，从而非法访问敏感文件。该漏洞影响 SunOS 4.x 及 Solaris 早期版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0211"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1994-02-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:55Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 针对对应操作系统版本的安全补丁：SunOS 4.1.3/4.1.3_U1 安装补丁 101945-xx，Solaris 2.3 安装补丁 101358-xx，Solaris 2.4 安装补丁 101945-xx。无法立即打补丁时，将 /etc/exports 中每条导出条目控制在 256 字符以内，使用主机名/IP 而非 netgroup 进行访问控制，并在 NFS 服务端防火墙限制仅允许可信网络访问 portmap（111/tcp,111/udp）和 nfsd（2049/tcp,2049/udp）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/24","https://vuls.cert.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=96665790","https://vuls.cert.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=97124517","https://vuls.cert.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=97124527"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0397.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1422","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1422.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1242","title":"HP HP-UX subnetconfig 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 9.01 及 9.0 版本中的 subnetconfig 组件存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者在已获取系统普通账户访问权限的条件下，可通过利用 subnetconfig 对输入参数处理不当的缺陷，以 root 权限执行任意命令，从而实现本地提权。该漏洞无法远程利用，仅限本地攻击，攻击者需具有系统本地账户方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1242"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1994-02-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:01Z","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 至 10.x 或更新的受支持版本，或移除 `subnetconfig` 的 setuid 权限位：`chmod u-s /usr/sbin/subnetconfig`。限制不可信用户的本地登录权限，并审核 `/etc/passwd` 中可登录用户列表。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/advisories/hpalert/003","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2162","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1242.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1242.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1242","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1242.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1242.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g6hx-v77f-92pc/GHSA-g6hx-v77f-92pc.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87846/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1242.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1422.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0362","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0181","title":"Unix rpc.walld 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"rpc.walld（wall daemon）是 Unix 系统中用于向所有在线终端广播消息的 RPC 服务，默认通过 rpc 协议监听网络请求。该服务存在访问控制缺陷，未授权远程攻击者无需认证即可向其发送特制 RPC 请求，向所有登录用户终端广播虚假消息，导致拒绝服务或社会工程攻击。部分实现中攻击者还可利用调试功能或命令行注入执行任意远程命令。该漏洞影响 Solaris、HP-UX 等 Unix 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0181"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1994-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:46Z","remediation":"禁用 rpc.walld 服务（如不需全局广播功能），或通过 tcpwrappers 在 /etc/hosts.deny 添加 `walld: ALL` 限制访问来源。各 UNIX 厂商（如 Sun、HP、IBM）曾发布对应补丁，建议查阅原厂安全公告获取对应修复包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0181"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0550","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0550.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0334","title":"Sun Solaris fsck 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.2 和 2.3 系统中，fsck（文件系统一致性检查）在系统启动过程中执行失败后，系统会降级至单用户维护模式，此时拥有物理访问权限的本地用户无需认证即可直接获取 root shell 权限。该漏洞属于本地权限提升漏洞，攻击者须具备物理接触目标主机的条件，通过在系统引导阶段触发 fsck 检查失败来利用此问题，进而完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，影响 Solaris 2.2 及 2.3 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0334"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1993-12-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:10Z","remediation":"升级到 Solaris 2.4 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，应限制物理访问，确保控制台仅授权人员可用，并在系统启动时值守以防止 fsck 被交互式劫持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0334"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0550.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1351","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1351.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1137","title":"Sun Solaris 和 SunOS /dev/audio 本地权限许可漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.2 及更早版本、SunOS 4.1.x 系统中 /dev/audio 音频设备的权限配置存在缺陷，允许任意本地用户读取该设备文件。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞监听目标机器附近麦克风捕获的对话内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞源于操作系统对音频设备文件访问控制不当，攻击者只需拥有本地账户即可实施监听，无需额外权限。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1137"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1993-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:47Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris 至 2.3 及以上版本，或 SunOS 至 5.x 系列。如无法升级，手动修改 /dev/audio 权限为 600（仅 root 可读写）：chmod 600 /dev/audio；若无需麦克风功能，可在系统 BIOS 或硬件层面禁用音频输入设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/122&type=0&nav=sec.sba","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/e-01.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/6436","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/549","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aa3114da1227373bef7855dba21bcaa5f0e0ad76/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1137.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1137","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1137.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4d2ed764072119c12b6f84e6ee4e0df62586a8c4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1137.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2339193e1c10dc2db330718adeb8cc8d88c4dd/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-whwh-8wm3-8f72/GHSA-whwh-8wm3-8f72.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88473/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1137.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--63f990c9-7adc-4167-806f-6cfdb2a30758.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--63f990c9-7adc-4167-806f-6cfdb2a30758.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1351.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0298","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0298.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0145","title":"Sendmail WIZ 命令远程权限提升漏洞","description":"Sendmail WIZ 命令漏洞存在于 sendmail 邮件服务器软件中，其 DEBUG 模式的 WIZ 命令默认开启且未经身份认证。远程攻击者可直接连接至 SMTP 端口（25/TCP），发送 WIZ 命令后输入 root 即可获得目标系统最高权限，实现完全控制。该漏洞影响早期版本 sendmail，危害严重，攻击门槛极低，无需任何前置条件即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0145"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1993-09-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:41Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.6.10 或更新版本（该版本已移除 WIZ 调试命令），或在 sendmail.cf 中注释或移除 `Ow` 相关 WIZ 选项来禁用 WIZ 命令。若无法立即升级，应在防火墙上限制对 TCP 25 端口的访问，仅允许可信来源连接 SMTP 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Jun/16","http://www.alw.nih.gov/Security/Docs/admin-guide-to-cracking.101.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1990-11.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1993-14.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/06/05/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/06/06/1","http://www2.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1995_1/0332.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0298.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1477","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1477.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1318","title":"Sun SunOS su 命令搜索路径本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.1.3 及之前版本中 /usr/5bin/su 程序存在搜索路径安全隐患，其查找可执行文件时将当前工作目录 (.) 置于系统目录之前，导致本地攻击者可在当前目录放置特洛伊木马程序，利用 su 命令以提升的权限执行恶意代码，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 SunOS 4.1.3 及更早版本，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1318"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1993-09-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:11Z","remediation":"立即安装 Sun 官方补丁 100630（可从 SunSolve 获取）修复 /usr/5bin/su 搜索路径含当前目录的问题。如无法打补丁，手动编辑 /usr/5bin/su 脚本，在调用外部命令前将 PATH 设为安全值（如 /bin:/usr/bin）并移除 '.'。亦可升级至 Solaris 2.x 或更高版本彻底规避此漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fpatches%2F100630&zone_32=112193%2A%20","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7480.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1318.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1318","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1318.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1318.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8xmr-63w7-h7w2/GHSA-8xmr-63w7-h7w2.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-427.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e66c16e4-cc93-492d-beba-489e3d048b46.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1318.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1477.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1352","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1352.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1138","title":"SCO UNIX System V/386 弱默认目录权限导致本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UNIX System V/386 Release 3.2 及其他 SCO 产品（如 Open Desktop、Open Desktop Lite、OpenServer）在安装时错误地将 dos 用户的家目录设置为 /tmp、将 asg 用户的家目录设置为 /usr/tmp。由于 /tmp 与 /usr/tmp 均为允许所有用户写入的世界可写（world-writable）目录，本地其他已登录用户可借此访问这两个账户的目录与文件，进而获取 dos 或 asg 用户的权限，造成权限提升或拒绝服务等安全影响。攻击条件为攻击者需拥有目标系统的本地普通用户账户，并能够向上述世界可写目录写入文件，利用目录权限配置不当即可越权访问相关账户。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1138"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1993-09-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:48Z","remediation":"将 dos 用户主目录由 /tmp 改为 /usr/dos 并设为 700 权限（chmod 700 /usr/dos；chown dos /usr/dos），将 asg 用户主目录由 /usr/tmp 改为 /usr/asg 并设为 700 权限（chmod 700 /usr/asg；chown asg /usr/asg），同时确保 /tmp、/usr/tmp 仅 root 可写（chmod 1777 并去除组/其他写权限）。建议升级至 SCO OpenServer 5.0.5 及以上已修正该配置的安全补丁版本，并审查 /etc/passwd 确认两账户主目录已更正。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1993-13.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/546","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1138.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1138","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1138.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1138.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1138.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3bc9583077e9d7007badef726c5b3560d73fb205/1999/CVE-1999-1138.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7d67702de1c8e6c388afcd41c6fc66f9bddaa76f/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-11xx/CVE-1999-1138.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1138.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1138.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1138.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1352.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1404","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1404.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1215","title":"Novell Netware 权限提升漏洞","description":"Novell Netware 4.0 和 4.01 版本中的 LOGIN.EXE 程序在用户登录过程中会将用户名和密码等敏感凭据临时写入磁盘文件，且未妥善保护文件权限。本地攻击者可通过读取这些临时文件获取明文凭据，进而提升权限并接管系统。该漏洞属于本地权限提升类别，CVSS 评分 4.6，影响范围限于 Novell Netware 4.0 和 4.01 版本，攻击条件要求攻击者具备本地系统访问权限。利用方式为直接读取 LOGIN.EXE 生成的临时凭据文件，无需复杂交互即可完成权限提升。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1215"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1993-09-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:57Z","remediation":"升级至 Novell Netware 4.11 或更高版本（已修复该漏洞），或应用 Novell 官方发布的 LOGIN.EXE 补丁程序。若无法立即升级，可限制本地用户对 LOGIN.EXE 临时文件目录的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/d-21.shtml","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1993-12.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/545","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1f3f1d799c1c9e44bc999093e18341513cabfa3f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1215.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1215","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1215.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fb79aaf8eeeb3ec551114292cd7a8693e166aee6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1215.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6da213119b3c54637329347c0dc42c66b8a84f0a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cqv7-rg6g-9wmv/GHSA-cqv7-rg6g-9wmv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88920/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1215.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8fe008f2-c39d-4acb-8551-ce51d6c8c061.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1404.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0270","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0270.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0124","title":"UMN Gopher 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"UMN Gopher 及 Gopher+ 服务程序（1.12 和 2.0x 版本）存在未授权任意文件读取漏洞。由于 gopherd 守护进程未能对文件访问请求进行充分的权限校验，攻击者可以利用该缺陷绕过访问限制，读取 gopher 守护进程可访问范围内的任意系统文件，包括敏感配置信息。此漏洞无需认证即可远程触发，攻击难度低，对系统机密性构成严重威胁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0124"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1993-08-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:38Z","remediation":"升级 UMN gopher 至 2.0.18 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。同时修改 gopherd 配置文件，设置根目录为仅含公开内容的隔离路径（如 /var/gopher），并使用 chroot 机制限制守护进程访问范围。通过文件系统权限确保 gopher 运行用户（如 nobody）对 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件无读取权限。如无需对外提供 Gopher 服务，建议直接停止并卸载 gopherd。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0124"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0270.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1372","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1372.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1162","title":"SCO Unix 4.0 passwd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SCO UNIX 4.0 及之前版本的 passwd 命令存在安全漏洞，本地攻击者可通过特定操作破坏 passwd 文件或相关认证机制，导致系统无法正常验证用户身份，进而阻止所有用户（包括合法用户）登录系统，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用门槛较低，具有本地访问权限的攻击者即可实施攻击。受影响版本包括 SCO UNIX 4.0 及更早版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1162"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1993-05-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:51Z","remediation":"SCO 已针对此漏洞发布补丁，建议升级至 SCO UNIX 4.2 或更高版本。对于已停止技术支持的老旧系统，应迁移至受支持的现代操作系统（如 Linux 或 BSD），并确保 passwd 及相关认证组件为最新版本。临时缓解措施可限制不可信用户对系统的本地访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1993-08.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/542.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1162.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1162","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1162.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1162.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3gg7-v77p-8v9j/GHSA-3gg7-v77p-8v9j.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88593/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1162.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000036.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c537183d-c5cf-4712-901a-b20fab9ad18b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1372.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1405","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1405.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1216","title":"Cisco 路由器 IP 源路由安全绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco 路由器 9.17 及更早版本存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 IP 源路由数据包，绕过本应通过 \"no ip source-route\" 命令拒绝的访问限制。该漏洞允许攻击者绕过 ACL 等安全策略，实现未授权网络访问。攻击者只需向目标路由器发送特制 IP 数据包即可触发，无需任何身份认证。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco IOS 9.17 及之前版本的路由器设备。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1216"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1993-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:57Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 到 9.17 以上版本以修复源路由绕过漏洞。在全局配置模式下执行 `no ip source-route` 命令禁用 IP 源路由功能，并在所有入站接口上配置 `ip verify unicast source reachable-via rx` 防止源地址欺骗。无法升级时，在边界路由器上使用 ACL 过滤源路由选项（IP 协议号 4）的数据包作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/d-15.shtml","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1993-07.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/541","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1216.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1216","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1216.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1216.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hq37-hh2w-qq3f/GHSA-hq37-hh2w-qq3f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87019/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1216.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000035.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d21e135a-2e80-4837-8cd7-33a0da206a1c.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1405.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1474","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1474.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1312","title":"DEC OpenVMS 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"DEC OpenVMS VAX 5.5-2 至 5.0 及 OpenVMS AXP 1.0 版本中存在未明本地页面管理漏洞，本地攻击者可通过利用系统页面管理机制的缺陷，成功触发后可提升至系统级权限，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞源于操作系统对内存页面的权限控制不当，攻击者需要拥有本地账户访问权限才能进行利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1312"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1993-02-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenVMS VAX 至 V5.5-2 以上版本，OpenVMS AXP 升级至 V1.0 以上版本，并安装 CERT/CC 公告 CA-1993-05 中对应的安全补丁。对于无法升级的遗留系统，应严格限制本地用户登录权限，仅授予可信管理员账户访问，并启用系统审计日志监控异常提权行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1993-05.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7142","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1312.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1312","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1312.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1312.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w94x-5hjw-v8h6/GHSA-w94x-5hjw-v8h6.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1312.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000034.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b5b319d3-3501-4f47-b755-2aa6aa228a37.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1474.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1548","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1548.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1507","title":"Sun SunOS 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Sun SunOS 4.1 至 4.1.3 版本中存在权限许可漏洞，系统对 crash 等文件及目录设置了不安全的默认权限，导致本地普通用户可读取或修改敏感系统文件，进而将权限提升至 root 级别。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用，但一旦获取低权限账号即可提权，对系统安全性造成严重威胁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1507"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1993-02-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 SunOS 至 4.1.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 crash 等系统文件及目录的默认权限问题。临时缓解措施：手动将 /var/crash 等敏感目录权限修改为 700，限制仅 root 用户可访问，并检查系统内其他存在不安全默认权限的文件和目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1993-03.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/59","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/521"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1548.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1548.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0523","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0523.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0312","title":"HP-UX ypbind NIS 数据篡改漏洞","description":"HP-UX 系统中 ypbind（NIS 绑定守护进程）存在安全漏洞，拥有 root 权限的攻击者可通过 ypbind 服务修改 NIS 网络信息服务中的数据。该漏洞影响 NIS 环境下的系统认证与配置信息分发机制，可能导致网络范围内身份认证绕过或系统关键配置被篡改，进而危害整个 NIS 域的安全性。攻击者需先获得本地 root 权限才能利用此漏洞进行数据篡改。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0312"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1993-01-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级 HP-UX 系统至厂商提供的最新安全补丁版本以修复 ypbind 漏洞，同时严格管控系统 root 权限的授予范围，限制非授权用户对 ypbind 服务的本地访问。对于生产环境，建议评估并逐步迁移至更安全的 LDAP 目录服务替代 NIS 进行身份认证和配置分发。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T13:26:12Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0312"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0523.toml"}]